WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:01.800
Come here quickly!

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.020
Come here immediately!

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.720
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.020
Say bye-bye to the teacher after class!

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.530
And bring back your gym clothes!

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:24.400
Wanna gather at the schoolyard to play?

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.160
Aren't you gonna give a good excuse?

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.710
Just leave that homework alone!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.700
Let's swing around the metal bars instead!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.770
That red backpack sure is strong

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:42.350
One, two, line up in threes!

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.880
And dash forward with the pencil case after school!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:49.950
You'll forget about it, so cheer up!

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:49.950
One

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:49.950
Two!

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:52.470
Hey Mr.! Turn around that corner!

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:56.760
Let's have a large assembly in the schoolyard!

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.100
Just who am I?

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:04.990
Can I still have fun when I grow up?

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:09.700
I don't know, but I just wanna know!

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:15.060
If we can still laugh over the small matters

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.660
I'm happy enough with that!

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.340
This! That! And everything else!

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:27.200
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:43.500
Hey, Futaba. Did you catch a cold again?

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.650
It's already Summer, too...

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.630
This is an experiment!

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:51.710
An experiment?

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.190
That's right!

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:57.420
In preparation for Summer, I wanted to see how breezy it gets without any panties on.

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:58.350
Satou Shinya
...Probably
An honor student...

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:01.990
Hey...

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.670
This is really effective, you know!

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:10.090
Why don't you give it a try as well, Shin?!

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.530
A-As if I'd do something that stupid!

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:17.750
Shin is so cold.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.160
Man, what is wrong with her?

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.130
Hey, Satou.

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:23.300
What's up, Chiba?

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.880
You sure get along well with Futaba, don't you?

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:27.400
No, not really.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.810
We're just childhood friends. That's all.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:32.080
Have you seen them, then?

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.300
Seen what?

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.170
Futaba's panties.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.980
Wh-What are you...

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:38.910
Why on earth would I?

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:41.030
At any rate, what are you up to?

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:45.790
I was just wondering if I could see this manga's heroine's panties

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.400
Is there something wrong with your head?

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:51.830
I was joking!

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.780
You're not supposed to bring that sort of thing to school in the first place.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:59.790
It's about time I graduate from manga and get my hands on some of the real stuff.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.750
The Superior Child In Body and Mind
Chiba Yuudai

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:01.850
That's not good, Hitoha.

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:05.090
Bringing that book to school again...

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.910
If that's how it is...

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.700
Don't come over anymore, okay?!

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:17.400
What on earth is this book?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:24.780
Incredible...

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:26.710
Incredible!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.000
What's wrong?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.050
D-Don't worry about it.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.430
Geez, that Chiba...

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:42.810
Does he really want to see panties that badly?

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:47.850
Wanna try going without panties?

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:48.820
Is that him and the third daughter? Where are they going?

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:48.810
You don't want to?

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.090
I beg of you!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.100
Please allow me to see them!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.730
Did he just ask her to show him?!

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:05.640
Don't tell me he wants to see her panties!

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.170
I beg you, just this once!

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:08.650
No.

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:11.550
I'm prostrating myself before you!

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:12.420
No.

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.880
Even... Even just a little bit?!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:15.370
Nope.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:18.470
I'll do whatever you tell me for a whole day! Please!

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:20.660
I'm sure Mitsuba would love to hear that.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.960
Please! Wait, Third Daughter!

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:29.150
Satou?

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:30.990
Did you hear the whole thing?!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:31.980
Chiba...

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.910
I know that I'm pathetic!

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:37.200
Do you really want to see it that badly?!

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.820
Of course, I want to see it!

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:46.170
With just a single glance, we will be ushered into a world of dreams yet unknown to us!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.150
A world of dreams?

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:51.920
Earlier, in the classroom...

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:55.140
...I caught a small glimpse.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.420
Are you serious?

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.760
It was bad.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:00.440
It was even better than I had imagined.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.950
It's the Third Daughter, though!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.010
That's right.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.110
Are you sure?

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.180
It doesn't really seem to match her character.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:10.430
If she chooses not to show it to me...

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:15.610
...I'll have no choice but to take it by force!

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:19.080
You're going to steal them?!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:21.590
You can't! That's a crime!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.740
It should be fine as long as I return it later, right?

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.640
That's not the problem here!

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:31.040
Enough! I can't waste time arguing with you about something so important!

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:33.670
Hey!

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:44.240
That Chiba... Why'd he go home so early?

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:47.610
At this rate, he'll really become a criminal.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.890
In any case...

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:53.800
Maybe if I ask Futaba, she'll bring me some of the third daughter's panties.

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:58.510
I brought lots for you, Shin!

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:00.080
There's no way in hell!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:03.000
If I ask her, it's just going to get more out of hand.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.600
In that case...

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:07.910
Maybe I should sneak into their room and take some from their pantie drawer.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:12.550
That would make me the criminal, wouldn't it?!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.810
Third Daughter?!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:16.740
Satou!

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:19.040
Hold her down for me!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.600
Hey! Come to your senses already!

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:24.760
Listen here, Chiba.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.270
I won't let you do this anymore!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.440
Alright, Satou.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:33.500
Show them to me!

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:34.940
That thing you have...

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:36.330
Me?

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.870
When you say me...

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:41.950
Mine?!

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:44.210
That's right! Come on and show me already!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.450
You're really fine with a guy's?

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:48.780
Just show me what's inside there.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:52.410
Please, just the inside...

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.330
Stop it! Don't touch me!

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:57.330
Come on, it's fine. Just give it here! It's not even yours!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.760
I'll take responsibility for it!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:00.760
How could you?!

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:10.640
The real one

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:07.910
Hitoha?

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.290
Do you always go home by yourself?

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:12.750
Yeah.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.900
Where are Mitsuba and Futaba?

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.140
I do not know.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:20.070
Oh, well... It's been kind of dangerous lately, so maybe we should go back together.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.180
I'll be fine.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:24.180
But, you know, since you're so cute...

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:26.060
What a lolicon.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.570
No! I'm not!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.110
Why don't you go over there and ask those girls?

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:32.940
I can't.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.890
Just try asking them if you can go home together.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:35.710
I don't want to.

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:39.220
Are you saying that I should die, Teacher?

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.070
Aren't you exaggerating a bit?

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:42.070
Yabe-chi!

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.980
Bye-bye!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:44.830
Look...

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.220
Um...

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.900
She screamed!

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:57.060
Wh-What is it?

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.080
I've failed.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.840
I'll just give up now.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.820
B-Be sure to be careful...

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.950
...on your way home.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.880
Is there something we need to be careful of?

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.200
We better hurry home before it's dark!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.590
Ah...

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:19.820
I just wanted to tell them to be careful on their way home.

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.320
See? It's useless!

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:23.410
That's not true at all!

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:26.950
You just need to relax and try to smile a bit more, okay?

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:34.230
Afternoon cleaning duty sure is a pain.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:37.690
Third Daughter!

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:45.540
It looks like she's interacting with someone... No, something...

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.490
Oh, a mosquito.

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:52.510
She's fighting against some invisible force?

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.020
I have to get away!

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:59.330
It's going to suck me dry!

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.860
What could it be?!

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:08.690
You did it, Hitoha!

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:17.670
Was I finally able to go home with someone because of my training?

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:21.320
Say, Third Daughter. You really must have that sort of constitution, huh?

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:24.140
Constitution? Is she talking about that mosquito?

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:27.050
Well, it may just be that I'm an easy target.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.710
An easy target... I knew it!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.210
That must be hard on you.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.850
Well, it's not all bad.

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:35.160
They tend to be more abundant in the Summer.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.690
That's probably because of Obon and other stuff, I bet!

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:41.730
Oh, I forgot! My name's Sakiko Matsuoka.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.640
I know.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:46.240
Oh, that's right.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.300
We are classmates, after all.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:51.720
Even though I don't know her real name...

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.870
Maybe I should talk about something.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.770
You know, for a while now...

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.000
...I've really liked you!

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:04.670
Huh?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:08.370
I'm so happy to be able to go home with you like this!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.000
Oh, Third Daughter!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.960
To think that you had the constitution to draw out spirits...

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:17.410
Y-You mean...

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:25.870
Do you find it gross?

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:28.030
N-No, it's not that.

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:31.220
We've never even spoken to each other before.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.310
You could say that I'm really into scary stuff.

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:37.680
You have no idea how much I've stayed up to research this stuff in the middle of the night.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:41.180
You watch those kinds of videos at night?!

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:44.200
Oh! Sister!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.380
Aren't you adorable?

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:47.280
Spirits Special!
The world which no one knows about,
Right at this very evening, you will soon witness!!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.650
But, from now on... You can help teach me...

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:56.160
...all kinds of things, right?

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:00.750
What's wrong? You seem a little different than before.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:02.280
Third Daughter?!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:09.500
I hope she's doing alright.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.620
Was it really a good idea to have her go home with Matsuoka?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.540
Begone! Begone from Third Daughter!

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.910
Amen to the sacred sutra!

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:20.190
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:22.260
Don't interfere!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:23.540
Eek...!

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:24.480
I'm in the middle of an exorcism here!

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:32.290
So, you still won't leave her, will you?!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.610
Begone! Begone! Begone!

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:39.000
This... This is all my fault!

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:55.850
This damned annoying season has reared its ugly head once more.

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:59.020
Third Daughter, Summer is the season for spirits, isn't it?!

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:07.110
As a beautiful and smart spirit medium, you must be really busy...

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.560
...dealing with all those encroaching evil spirits, huh?

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:12.580
It must get pretty melancholic.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:16.380
It looks like she's still harboring a huge misconception.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.270
Good luck, Third Daughter!

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:20.000
I'm not really...

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.080
Oh, don't be so modest.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.370
Everything will be fine since you're pretty.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.100
That's not right at all.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.750
Look at that. The pool should be open tomorrow.

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:31.640
I'm looking forward to it.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.120
The pool... Swimming...

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:37.600
What meaningless labor humans must endure.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:47.140
The pool... The pool...

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.860
The pool...

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:51.530
The pool? What is she trying to say?

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:55.910
Could it be that there's something lurking in the pool?!

00:12:55.910 --> 00:13:01.840
Third Daughter! In preparation for the pool's opening tomorrow, why don't we sneak in tonight?

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:04.840
We must be prepared for what is to come tomorrow!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.320
If there's anything I can do to help, just tell me!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.680
This is the breaststroke.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.990
Fight! Fight!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.170
Matsuoka.

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:24.650
Well then, let's begin the exorcism!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.610
Exorcism?!

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.610
Just what I'd expect from you.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:30.060
By floating in the pool, you'll be able to sense the spirits, right?

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:33.860
What am I doing here, anyway?

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:36.680
I even wore my swimsuit under my clothes.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:38.500
Huh? What's that?

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:43.040
Those must be items for exterminating the spirits, right?

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:43.800
Wait...

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.500
Do you use them like this?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.090
Give it back!

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:57.910
Where are you going? What about the exorcism?

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.350
I'm sorry, but...

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:03.480
...I'd like it if you didn't talk to me anymore.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:05.650
Third Daughter?

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:07.310
Does that mean...

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:11.320
I'm still an inexperienced user.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:14.850
It would be better if you didn't get too involved with the other side.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:18.070
What incredible kindness through modesty!

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.870
Did I make her cry?

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:22.410
Please. I'll be fine.

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:24.600
I've already prepared for the worst!

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:26.250
Look!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:28.080
In order to avoid being chased by any spirits...

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.720
...I've applied sutras over my whole body!

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:33.390
<i>Oh my god!</i>

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.400
Could it be that's you've already been possessed?

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.440
You should be the one who's exhausted.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.960
I've not been used at all!

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.260
I'm still rearing to go!

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:45.620
I think there really is something wrong with you.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:50.270
By assimilation? You mean you and the spirit become one?

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:52.310
So, you have that sort of power, too!

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:54.450
P-Please don't come any closer!

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:59.170
By Assimilation

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:59.680
Third Daughter?!

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:03.230
I see! You must have already discovered the location of a spirit, right?

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.540
That's why you were telling me to stay away.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.530
He-Help... me...

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:10.430
Wh-What an intense fight!

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:13.450
Evil spirits, disperse!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:15.530
Third Daughter! Fight!

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:17.290
That...

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.890
Allow me to assist you in battle!

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.190
Sacred sutra, amen...

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:24.960
G-Give me that...

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.920
That? You mean...

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.270
I'm dying-

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:28.570
You mean this thing, right?

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.780
No, not that!

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.590
Is it this?

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:38.040
Or, did you want this?

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:43.120
Goodbye, cruel world.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.870
Matsuoka, I will curse you for this.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:47.840
I'll curse you.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.360
I'll curse you forever!

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.800
What is the meaning of this, you guys?!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.990
Good work! Were you able to successfully complete the exorcism?

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:04.740
Exorcism? Wasn't she just drowning?

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:08.740
Of course not. Third Daughter would never do something so foolish.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:10.580
Isn't that right, Third Daughter?

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:15.760
I crossed blades with a formidable opponent!

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.210
See?

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:23.340
I'm really going to curse you forever!

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.460
Matsuoka?!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.240
I accidentally used permanent markers to write these.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:32.230
Gross!

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:34.170
What were you thinking?

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:38.890
There are spirits lurking in this pool. I did this for the sake of exorcising them.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.490
Ew! Don't touch me!

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:44.850
It looks like the curse worked.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:49.380
Don't run away! Third Daughter, please explain to them!

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:51.110
Everyone!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.420
That sure was fun!

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:06.820
It'll be fine not to bathe after this, right?

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:08.530
That's not fine at all.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.920
Huh?

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:35.920
Those girls totally forgot to bring underwear even though they were wearing their swimsuits.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:40.320
What?

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:43.250
You all had your panties stolen?

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.130
Such a vulgar act.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:49.990
Well, I can understand why mine would be stolen due to their value, so that can't be helped.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:48.280
The Slightly Suspicious
Papa of the Triplets
Marui Soujirou

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:51.430
That only goes for mine, though.

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:54.630
They probably weren't actually stolen.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.210
Did you search properly?

00:17:56.210 --> 00:18:00.530
We looked everywhere! In all the nooks and crannies!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.700
Where do you think you're searching?!

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:05.870
You'd obviously want to wear them after you steal them, right?

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.500
Don't ask me!

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:11.370
The pool should be around here.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:16.640
Mitsuba. Don't you think it's odd that all three of us would have our panties stolen?

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:19.440
It would have been if it was just mine.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.780
No, what I'm trying to say...

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:26.660
The value of panties increases when there are more of them, doesn't it?

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.360
I see!

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:30.840
Those are really cheap!

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.750
Those aren't really something that you trade around.

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:35.630
One Piece
100 Yen
3-Piece Set
500 Yen

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:37.330
Are they really that cheap?

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:38.500
What is he doing over there?

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:39.480
Erm...

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.810
I guess I'll help you guys look for them, then.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:49.330
So, what kind of panties were they?

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.000
Well...

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.450
What kind were they?

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:53.830
That's what I've been saying the whole time...

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.430
That bastard!

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:01.920
Hey, girls! What color are your panties?

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:06.660
What is he doing with my daughters?!

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:12.830
Is there no entrance here?

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:13.960
That sort of person at a school?

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.190
Hello?

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:16.550
What's the matter?

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.520
They said that they lost their panties.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.460
Alright! Let's all help look for them.

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:28.050
Why did we have to forget them now of all times?

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:29.570
I've got it!

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:34.330
The criminal is... none other than Yabe-chi!

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:43.720
I've always noticed him looking at me with an intense gaze!

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:44.360
Futaba!

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:48.990
He should have something hiding underneath those clothes of his!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:59.080
As I thought, I'll just have to climb over this!

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.990
Just take a good look!

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.260
Where would I hide them?!

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:07.640
This bastard! Just wait until I get in there!

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:11.640
Look here! Take a good look!

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.110
It's the culprit!

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:23.920
Dad?!

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:33.150
It's Papa!

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:35.610
You damned pervert!

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.460
T-That's my line!

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.230
Are you guys alright?

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:43.400
Don't get any closer to those girls!

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:44.680
Look here.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.280
You guys forgot these, didn't you?

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:49.790
Did she finally realize?

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:54.020
Hey. Could it be that they weren't actually stolen...

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:56.350
That's right.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:01.020
Don't touch me, you pantie thief!

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:03.510
What are you saying?!

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.760
Stand down obediently, you deviant!

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:24.170
You're wrong! I was just delivering these panties to them!

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:27.810
Hurry up and take him away! He's making me sick!

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:29.840
You brats!

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:32.640
I'll go talk to him myself.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:35.860
You shouldn't approach the deviant, you know.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.150
Wait a second!

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.300
He's gone.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:49.720
Let us out! It's our fault so please let us out!

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:52.840
We're really sorry!

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:55.000
We're sorry!!!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.000
Good grief.

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:22.060
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:27.350
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:27.600 --> 00:22:32.570
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:37.810
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:38.090 --> 00:22:43.360
Let's go to sleep

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:47.310
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:54.400
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:54.820 --> 00:22:59.350
You can even fly into the sky

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:13.900
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:19.310
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:30.320
Next time, we'll have a story about panties and boobs!

00:23:30.320 --> 00:23:32.700
Why do I have to endure those kinds of stories?

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:34.690
Just leave the boobs to me.

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:36.550
You take care of the panties, okay, Shin?

00:23:36.550 --> 00:23:38.390
Why are you telling me all this?!
